#: ../../zh/autotune_guide.md:371
msgid "小结"
msgstr "Summary"

#: ../../zh/autotune_guide.md:373
msgid ""
"Triton-Ascend 相比社区 autotune 的关键扩展，不是改变用户接口，而是在社区接口之上增加了“自动生成 Tiling "
"候选并完成寻优”的能力。对大多数用户来说，最推荐的使用方式就是："
msgstr ""
"The key extension of Triton-Ascend compared to the community autotune is not"
" changing the user interface, but adding the capability to \"automatically "
"generate Tiling candidates and complete optimization\" on top of the "
"community interface. For most users, the most recommended usage is:"

#: ../../zh/autotune_guide.md:375
msgid "保持社区版 `@triton.autotune` 的写法；"
msgstr "Keep the writing style of the community edition `@triton.autotune`;"

#: ../../zh/autotune_guide.md:376
msgid "将 `configs` 设为 `[]`；"
msgstr "Set `configs` to `[]`;"

#: ../../zh/autotune_guide.md:377
msgid "让 Ascend backend 基于 kernel DSL 和运行时 shape 自动完成候选生成、筛选、benchmark 与缓存复用。"
msgstr ""
"Enable the Ascend backend to automatically complete candidate generation, "
"filtering, benchmarking, and cache reuse based on the kernel DSL and runtime"
" shapes."

#: ../../zh/autotune_guide.md:379
msgid "如果场景不适合自动 Tiling 模式，再回到手写 `triton.Config` 即可。"
msgstr ""
"If the scenario is not suitable for automatic Tiling mode, simply return to "
"manually writing `triton.Config`."
